# dist/ is intentionally tracked so Git-backed Databricks Apps can serve the SPA
# without running npm. package.json stays under frontend/ so Apps does not
# auto-run npm install at startup. Rebuild before commit or deploy:
# `python scripts/build_frontend.py` (also run by scripts/deploy_app.py).


